<sp who="#MAR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Marquis</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p><hi rendition="#et">Hier i&#x017F;t er &#x017F;chon.</hi></p></sp></div><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/>
<pb n="49" facs="#f0059"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#g">Er&#x017F;ter Akt</hi>.</fw><lb/>
<div n="3"><head><hi rendition="#g">Fünfter Auftritt</hi>.</head><lb/>
<stage><hi rendition="#g">Die Königinn. Dom Karlos</hi>.</stage><lb/>
<stage>Marquis von Po&#x017F;a und die Marqui&#x017F;inn von Mon-<lb/>
