<sp who="#KAR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Karlos</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Sie haben nie geliebt?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#KOENIGI"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Königinn</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p><hi rendition="#et">Selt&#x017F;ame Frage!</hi></p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#KAR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Karlos</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Sie haben nie geliebt?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#KOENIGI"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Königinn</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p><hi rendition="#et">&#x2014; Ich liebe nicht mehr.</hi></p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#KAR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Karlos</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Weil es Ihr Herz? Weil es Ihr Eid verbietet?</p></sp><lb/>
<pb n="57" facs="#f0067"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#g">Er&#x017F;ter Akt</hi>.</fw><lb/>
<sp who="#KOENIGI"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Königinn</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
