<fw type="sig" place="bottom">M 2</fw><lb/>
<pb n="180" facs="#f0190"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#g">Dom Karlos.</hi></fw><lb/>
<sp who="#ALB"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Alba</hi></speaker> <stage>fin&#x017F;ter.</stage><lb/>
<p><hi rendition="#et">Daß Sie</hi><lb/>
mich daran mahnen mü&#x017F;&#x017F;en! <hi rendition="#g">die&#x017F;en</hi> Wurm<lb/>
aus &#x017F;einem Schlummer &#x017F;tören mü&#x017F;&#x017F;en! &#x2014;<lb/>
Gerne<lb/>
er&#x017F;tickt&#x2019; ich die Erinnerung.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#DOMI"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Domingo.</hi></speaker><lb/>
<p><hi rendition="#et">An was?</hi><lb/>
