<sp who="#LER"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Lerma.</hi></speaker><lb/>
<p>Der König i&#x017F;t für niemand.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#RAIM"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Taxis.</hi></speaker><lb/>
